.DS_Store
.env.todoai

# Spec Kit machine-local pointer — REQUIRED at root level, not only in .specify/.gitignore.
# Spec Kit Standard Rev C, precondition P3: an ignore rule inside .specify/ is branch-scoped,
# so it does not exist on branches without the scaffold (records-only main) and does not survive
# `git branch -D` of a rejected feature branch — checkout never deletes untracked files, so the
# file outlives the rule meant to cover it and one `git add -A` commits it. This line is on
# every branch that carries this file, which is the point.
.specify/feature.json
